        "text": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>The Toniebox is a well-loved choice. These are the differences that matter most when you compare it with Voxblock.</p><ul><li><strong>Price.</strong> The Toniebox 2 is £104.99. The Voxblock player is £49.99.</li><li><strong>Setup.</strong> A Toniebox needs wi-fi to set up and to download its audio. Voxblock has no setup: put a book on the player and press play.</li><li><strong>How stories arrive.</strong> Tonies stories come as figurines placed on top of the box. A Voxblock audiobook is a solid cardboard book that slots into the player, with the story stored inside.</li><li><strong>Age range.</strong> Voxblock has stories for toddlers up to teens, including unabridged novels for older children.</li></ul>"
          }
        }
